{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1758","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Range = √Sum"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an integer $$$n$$$. Find a sequence of $$$n$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ such that $$$1 \\leq a_i \\leq 10^9$$$ for all $$$i$$$ and $$$$$$\\max(a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n) - \\min(a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n)= \\sqrt{a_1 + a_2 + \\dots + a_n}.$$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It can be proven that there exists a sequence of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers that satisfies all the conditions above."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and only line of each test case contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\leq n \\leq 3 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the sequence you have to find."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$3 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output $$$n$$$ space-separated "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ satisfying the conditions in the statement. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are several possible answers, you can output any of them. Please remember that your integers must be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"!"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n2\n5\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 1\n20 29 18 26 28\n25 21 23 31\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, the maximum is $$$3$$$, the minimum is $$$1$$$, the sum is $$$4$$$, and $$$3 - 1 = \\sqrt{4}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, the maximum is $$$29$$$, the minimum is $$$18$$$, the sum is $$$121$$$, and $$$29-18 = \\sqrt{121}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, the integers are all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"